deck) generated by `tools/make_car_kit.py`. It is styled after the
CC0 low-poly vehicles design reference
https://sketchfab.com/3d-models/free-low-poly-vehicles-pack-cb7640039e7a40679a53be705ebff50e
(CC0), credited here as the design reference; no Sketchfab file is
