vendored.

No third-party file is vendored; bodies are original procedural
stand-ins in that style.

Audio kit (procedural originals)
------------------------------
`assets/audio/engine.wav`, `assets/audio/skid.wav`,
`assets/audio/wind.wav`, `assets/audio/click.wav` and
`assets/audio/music_menu.wav` are original minimal procedural CC0
stand-ins (22050 Hz mono 16-bit PCM loops: a harmonic engine tone
for pitch-follows-RPM, filtered-noise skid and wind loops, a short
UI click one-shot, and an 8-second looping menu music pad)
generated by `tools/make_audio.py`. No third-party file is vendored;
all five tracks are original CC0 (CC0-1.0) compositions synthesized
from integer-cycle sine partials so they loop seamlessly. Volumes
drive the Master/Music/SFX buses (see `scripts/game/settings.gd`
_apply_volumes, which creates Music/SFX at runtime when missing);
ducking for races lives in `scripts/game/audio_manager.gd`.
